    <briefdescription>
<para>A base class for a doubly linked list node. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a pair of uninitialised pointers to the <bold>next</bold> and <bold>previous</bold> elements in a doubly linked list, along with a set of simple (some inlined) methods to access and manipulate these pointers.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Both regular and statically allocated list elements are derived from this class. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
